---
description: RXV zero-cost development policy
alwaysApply: true
---

Before making architecture or code changes:

1. Read /AGENTS.md
2. Read /COST_LIMITS.json
3. Follow FREE_ONLY policy
4. Prefer frontend, local processing, static data and free services
5. Do not introduce metered or paid services without explicit user approval
6. Do not use Supabase Storage for large images, videos, ZIPs or backups
7. Do not add heavy Vercel Functions if frontend or local processing can do the job
8. If a change may create recurring or usage-based cost, stop and explain the risk before implementing it
